WEBVTT

00:35:00.288 --> 00:35:03.329
It's like a single model that understands
enough of what's really going

00:35:03.329 --> 00:35:07.079
on to do a broad array of tasks
and learn new things quickly,

00:35:07.079 --> 00:35:11.621
sort of like people can. And then
eventually we'll get to this other realm.

00:35:11.829 --> 00:35:14.621
Some people call it ajai, some
people call ostler things.

00:35:15.079 --> 00:35:19.621
But I think it implies that the systems
are like to some degree self directed,

00:35:20.496 --> 00:35:22.204
have some intentionality of their own

00:35:23.371 --> 00:35:25.454
is a simple summary to say that,

00:35:25.454 --> 00:35:28.871
like the fundamental risk is that there's

00:35:29.163 --> 00:35:32.079
the potential with general artificial
intelligence of